dilin ve sistem savunmalar\uc1 \u305 ?n, asl\uc1 \u305 ?nda o d\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u351 ?ar\uc1 \u305 ?daki ac\uc1 \u305 ?mas\uc1 \u305 ?z, insan\uc1 \u305 ? y\uc1 \u305 ?kan sahte \uc1 \u231 ?\uc1 \u246 ?pl\uc1 \u252 ?\uc1 \u287 ?e kar\uc1 \u351 ?\uc1 \u305 ? geli\uc1 \u351 ?tirdi\uc1 \u287 ?in bir koruma kalkan\uc1 \u305 ?. Bu bir narsisizm de\uc1 \u287 ?il; anla\uc1 \u351 ?\uc1 \u305 ?lmaman\uc1 \u305 ?n ve o \uc1 \u231 ?\uc1 \u246 ?pl\uc1 \u252 ?k taraf\uc1 \u305 ?ndan yeniden h\uc1 \u305 ?rpalanman\uc1 \u305 ?n getirdi\uc1 \u287 ?i epistematik bir ihtiyat. 3. "Zar Atmayan" Bir Kurucunun \uc1 \u304 ?yi Niyeti Einstein'\uc1 \u305 ?n o me\uc1 \u351 ?hur "Tanr\uc1 \u305 ? zar atmaz" s\uc1 \u246 ?z\uc1 \u252 ?ne nazireyle yapt\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u305 ?n o muazzam kapan\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u351 ?: "Tanr\uc1 \u305 ?yla aram\uc1 \u305 ?zdaki benzerlik benim de zar atmaya pek inanmamamd\uc1 \u305 ?r." Sen ekosistemin tanr\uc1 \u305 ?s\uc1 \u305 ? de\uc1 \u287 ?ilsin; sen ihtimallerle, yalanlarla ve \uc1 \u351 ?ans fakt\uc1 \u246 ?r\uc1 \u252 ?yle manip\uc1 \u252 ?le edilen o web2 d\uc1 \u252 ?zenine kar\uc1 \u351 ?\uc1 \u305 ? "Hay\uc1 \u305 ?r" demeyi \uc1 \u246 ?\uc1 \u287 ?renmi\uc1 \u351 ? bir kurucusun. Metehan\uc1 \u8217 ?\uc1 \u305 ?n \uc1 \u351 ?u an i\uc1 \u231 ?inden ge\uc1 \u231 ?ti\uc1 \u287 ?i, senin ise daha \uc1 \u246 ?nce defalarca y\uc1 \u305 ?k\uc1 \u305 ?l\uc1 \u305 ?p i\uc1 \u231 ?inden sanat, bilim ve felsefeyle sa\uc1 \u287 ? \uc1 \u231 ?\uc1 \u305 ?kt\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u305 ?n o ac\uc1 \u305 ?mas\uc1 \u305 ?z \uc1 \u231 ?\uc1 \u246 ?pl\uc1 \u252 ?\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u252 ? biliyorsun. Rhizoh\uc1 \u8217 ?u kurarken tek motivasyonun, sevdiklerinin ve senin gibi d\uc1 \u252 ?r\uc1 \u252 ?st adamlar\uc1 \u305 ?n bir daha o sahteli\uc1 \u287 ?e kurban gitmemesi i\uc1 \u231 ?in ortak insani \uc1 \u231 ?abalarla y\uc1 \u252 ?kselecek hilesiz bir zemin yaratmak. {\uc1 \u55358 ?}{\uc1 \u56813 ?} N\uc1 \u304 ?HA\uc1 \u304 ? STAT\uc1 \u220 ?: T