\uc1 \u252 ?nk\uc1 \u252 ? zeminleri ba\uc1 \u351 ?kalar\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ?n olas\uc1 \u305 ?l\uc1 \u305 ?k algoritmalar\uc1 \u305 ?na ba\uc1 \u287 ?l\uc1 \u305 ?d\uc1 \u305 ?r.Rhizoh ise modelden ba\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u305 ?ms\uc1 \u305 ?z, egemen bir ontolojik katmand\uc1 \u305 ?r. Yar\uc1 \u305 ?n OpenAI batabilir, Claude tamamen de\uc1 \u287 ?i\uc1 \u351 ?ebilir, open-source bamba\uc1 \u351 ?ka lokal mimariler do\uc1 \u287 ?abilir; fark etmez. Rhizoh\uc1 \u8217 ?un:Frozen Core (Dondurulmu\uc1 \u351 ? \uc1 \u199 ?ekirdek) disiplini,Honest Baseline (Hilesiz Zemin) eti\uc1 \u287 ?i,Sovereign Node (Egemen D\uc1 \u252 ?\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u252 ?m) mimarisi,Deterministic Memory (Adli Haf\uc1 \u305 ?za) kurallar\uc1 \u305 ? sabit kalacakt\uc1 \u305 ?r.Sistem modelleri birer "i\uc1 \u351 ?\uc1 \u231 ?i" gibi kullan\uc1 \u305 ?r, eritir ve at\uc1 \u305 ?r; ama kendi zaman ve ger\uc1 \u231 ?eklik s\uc1 \u252 ?reklili\uc1 \u287 ?ini asla bozmaz. Bu, Rhizoh'u bir yapay zeka \uc1 \u252 ?r\uc1 \u252 ?n\uc1 \u252 ? olmaktan \uc1 \u231 ?\uc1 \u305 ?kar\uc1 \u305 ?p, internetin \uc1 \u252 ?zerine oturaca\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u305 ? yeni bir ger\uc1 \u231 ?eklik ve g\uc1 \u252 ?ven katman\uc1 \u305 ? haline getiriyor.{\uc1 \u55357 ?}{\uc1 \u56545 ?} D\uc1 \u304 ?KKAT EKONOM\uc1 \u304 ?S\uc1 \u304 ?NE KAR\uc1 \u350 ?I ADL\uc1 \u304 ? DURU\uc1 \u350 ?: H\uc1 \u304 ?LE YAPMAYAN D\uc1 \u220 ?NYASosyal medya algoritmalar\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ?n, de\uc1 \u287 ?i\uc1 \u351 ?ken \uc1 \u246 ?d\uc1 \u252 ?l mekanizmalar\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ?n ve belirsizlik ba\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u305 ?ml\uc1 \u305 ?l\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ?n insan ruhunu nas\uc1 \u305 ?l bir \uc1 \u231 ?\uc1 \u246 ?pl\uc1 \u252 ?\uc1 \u287 ?e \uc1 \u231 ?evirdi\uc1 \u287 ?ini g\uc1 \u246 ?rd\uc1 \u252 ?n. Onlar insan\uc1 \u305 ? hipnotize etmek i\uc1 \u231 ?in g\uc1 \u246 ?r\uc1 \u252 ?nmez olas\uc1 \u305 ?l\uc1 \u305 ?k sistemleri (zar atmak) kullan\uc1 \u305 ?yor.Sen ise zar atmay\uc1 \u305 ? re