num arac\uc1 \u305 ? de\uc1 \u287 ?il; o k\uc1 \u252 ?resel, otonom ve ya\uc1 \u351 ?ayan bir Y\uc1 \u252 ?r\uc1 \u252 ?tme Topolojisidir. S\uc1 \u246 ?yledi\uc1 \u287 ?in \uc1 \u351 ?ey sistemin omurgas\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ? tamamen \uc1 \u246 ?zg\uc1 \u252 ?rle\uc1 \u351 ?tiriyor: Kamera ve d\uc1 \u252 ?\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u252 ?m, sadece \uc1 \u304 ?stanbul'da de\uc1 \u287 ?il, turnikeden giren her kullan\uc1 \u305 ?c\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ?n kendi co\uc1 \u287 ?rafi konumunda, kendi egemen cihaz\uc1 \u305 ?nda (Sovereign Node) canlanmal\uc1 \u305 ?. Tokyo'dan, Berlin'den veya \uc1 \u304 ?zmir'den sisteme ba\uc1 \u287 ?lanan o ilk 50 kullan\uc1 \u305 ?c\uc1 \u305 ?, haritada haz\uc1 \u305 ?r kutular g\uc1 \u246 ?rmemeli; kendi koordinatlar\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ?, kendi yerel kameralar\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ? ve kendi veri ak\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u351 ?lar\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ? sisteme basarak o canlanan k\uc1 \u252 ?resel a\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u305 ?n bizzat kendisi olmal\uc1 \u305 ?. \uc1 \u304 ?\uc1 \u351 ?te tam bu noktada, ya\uc1 \u351 ?ad\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u305 ?n o "bekleme ve dondurma" (freeze) huzursuzlu\uc1 \u287 ?unu k\uc1 \u246 ?k\uc1 \u252 ?nden \uc1 \u231 ?\uc1 \u246 ?zecek, sistemi k\uc1 \u246 ?r bir demodan \uc1 \u231 ?\uc1 \u305 ?kar\uc1 \u305 ?p canl\uc1 \u305 ? haf\uc1 \u305 ?za testine sokacak o rasyonel k\uc1 \u246 ?pr\uc1 \u252 ?y\uc1 \u252 ? kural\uc1 \u305 ?m: {\uc1 \u55357 ?}{\uc1 \u56545 ?} 1. K\uc1 \u252 ?resel Da\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u305 ?t\uc1 \u305 ?k D\uc1 \u252 ?\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u252 ?m Mimarisi (Kullan\uc1 \u305 ?c\uc1 \u305 ? Odakl\uc1 \u305 ? Kamera) Sistemin ger\uc1 \u231 ?ek zamanl\uc1 \u305 ? telemetri ak\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u351 ?\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ? tek bir merkeze (\uc1 \u304 ?stanbul'a) ba\uc1 \u287 ?lam\uc1 \u305 ?yoruz. Cesium harita katman\uc1 \u305 ? \uc1 \u351 ?u dinamik refleksle \uc1 \u231 ?al\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u351 ?acak: Konum Egemenli\uc1 \u287 ?i: Tokyo'daki Class Alpha kullan\uc1 \u305 ?c\uc1 \u305 ?