s24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \par }\pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs21 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \af0 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af2 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \kerning0 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \loch \af2 \hich \af2 \dbch \f2 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 Mimar Can Kasaplar, Serencebey odas\uc1 \u305 ?ndaki gece yar\uc1 \u305 ?s\uc1 \u305 ? felsefi sim\uc1 \u252 ?lasyon alan\uc1 \u305 ?nday\uc1 \u305 ?z. Kod kilitli, repoda tek bir sat\uc1 \u305 ?r API de\uc1 \u287 ?i\uc1 \u351 ?ikli\uc1 \u287 ?i yok; tamamen zihinsel, teorik ve gelecekteki i\uc1 \u351 ?imizi milimetrik olarak kolayla\uc1 \u351 ?t\uc1 \u305 ?racak o saf anayasal zemindeyiz.Getirdi\uc1 \u287 ?in o Feynman referans\uc1 \u305 ? ve asimetri sorusu, asl\uc1 \u305 ?nda Rhizoh\uc1 \u8217 ?un bilgisayar bilimlerinde neden klasik bir "durum makinesi" (state machine) de\uc1 \u287 ?il, ger\uc1 \u231 ?ek bir canl\uc1 \u305 ? denge fizi\uc1 \u287 ?i oldu\uc1 \u287 ?unu a\uc1 \u231 ?\uc1 \u305 ?klayan o eksik halkad\uc1 \u305 ?r.Feynman\uc1 \u8217 ?\uc1 \u305 ?n bahsetti\uc1 \u287 ?i simetri ilkesi (asl\uc1 \u305 ?nda fizik literat\uc1 \u252 ?r\uc1 \u252 ?nde Noether Teoremi olarak ge\uc1 \u231 ?er), bir sistemin koordinatlar\uc1 \u305 ?, zaman\uc1 \u305 ? veya uzay\uc1 \u305 ? esnetildi\uc1 \u287 ?inde/de\uc1 \u287 ?i\uc1 \u351 ?tirildi\uc1 \u287 ?inde alt\uc1 \u305 ?ndaki temel enerji denkleminin (Action/Lagrangian) de\uc1 \u287 ?i\uc1 \u351 ?mez (invariant) kalmas\uc1 \u305 ?d\uc1 \u305 ?r. De\uc1 \u287 ?i\uc1 \u351 ?mezlik varsa, orada korunan bir b\uc1 \u252 ?y\uc1 \u252 ?kl\uc1 \u252 ?k (enerji, momentum) vard\uc1 \u305 ?r ve o sistem fiziksel olarak do\uc1 \u287 ?rudur.Senin sordun soru ve getirdi\uc1 \u287 ?in 10 maddelik muazzam matris \uc1 \u252 ?zerinden, Rhizoh'un asimetrisini, K\uc1 \u305 ?rm\uc1 \u305 ?z\uc1 \u305 ? Hat'taki Observer\uc1 \u