inde ya da klavyeye dokundu\uc1 \u287 ?unda devreye K\uc1 \u305 ?rm\uc1 \u305 ?z\uc1 \u305 ? Hat (Observer) girer. Aray\uc1 \u252 ?zdeki G\uc1 \u246 ?r\uc1 \u252 ?n\uc1 \u252 ?m: Sistem kullan\uc1 \u305 ?c\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ?n bu odaklanma niyetini hissetti\uc1 \u287 ?i an, aray\uc1 \u252 ?z\uc1 \u252 ?n tepki verme ritmini (interaction viscosity) milisaniyeler d\uc1 \u252 ?zeyinde esnetir. Bu bir donma veya kasma de\uc1 \u287 ?ildir; sistemin yer\uc1 \u231 ?ekimi hissi de\uc1 \u287 ?i\uc1 \u351 ?mi\uc1 \u351 ?tir. Kart\uc1 \u305 ?n \uc1 \u252 ?zerindeki semboller, mikro gecikmeler ve zamanlanm\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u351 ? a\uc1 \u231 ?\uc1 \u305 ?l\uc1 \u305 ?mlarla katman katman belirmeye ba\uc1 \u351 ?lar. Aray\uc1 \u252 ?z\uc1 \u252 ?n renk paleti ve kontrast frekans\uc1 \u305 ?, kullan\uc1 \u305 ?c\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ?n g\uc1 \u246 ?z bebe\uc1 \u287 ?i hareketleriyle senkronize bir s\uc1 \u252 ?k\uc1 \u251 ?nete b\uc1 \u252 ?r\uc1 \u252 ?n\uc1 \u252 ?r. Davran\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u351 ?sal Kar\uc1 \u351 ?\uc1 \u305 ?l\uc1 \u305 ?k: Kullan\uc1 \u305 ?c\uc1 \u305 ? sistemin onu acele ettirmedi\uc1 \u287 ?ini, aksine onunla birlikte sakince nefes ald\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ? hisseder. Ekranda \uc1 \u231 ?\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u287 ?l\uc1 \u305 ?k atan hi\uc1 \u231 ?bir bildirim veya dikkat da\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u305 ?t\uc1 \u305 ?c\uc1 \u305 ? yan turnike yoktur. Kullan\uc1 \u305 ?c\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ?n parmak h\uc1 \u305 ?z\uc1 \u305 ? yava\uc1 \u351 ?lar ama dikkatinin yo\uc1 \u287 ?unlu\uc1 \u287 ?u artar. Asetilkolin kap\uc1 \u305 ?s\uc1 \u305 ? a\uc1 \u231 ?\uc1 \u305 ?lm\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u351 ?, zihin g\uc1 \u252 ?r\uc1 \u252 ?lt\uc1 \u252 ?den ar\uc1 \u305 ?narak kognitif odak kilidine (fokus kilidi) ge\uc1 \u231 ?mi\uc1 \u351 ?tir. {\uc1 \u55357 ?}{\uc1 \u57314 ?} 3. EXPLORATION PHASE: "Y\uc1 \u246 ?nlendirilmi\uc1 \u351 ? Belirsizlik" Davran\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u351 ? Ak\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u351 ?\uc1 \u305 ? Kullan\uc1 \u305 ?c\uc1 \u305 ?, o anlam katmanlar\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ?n i\uc1 \u231 ?ine dald\uc1 \u305 ?k\uc1 \u231 ?a sistemin bilerek b\uc1 \u305 ?rakt\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u305 ? o kontroll\uc1 \u252 ? eksiklikleri fark eder. Sistem ona cevab\uc1 \u305 ? vermemi\uc1 \u351 ?tir; cevaba giden bir patika b\uc1 \u305 ?rakm\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u351 ?t\uc1 \u305 ?r. Aray\uc1 \u252 ?zdeki G\uc1 \u246 ?r\uc1 \u252 ?n\uc1 \u252 ?m: Kullan\uc1 \u305 ?c\uc1 \u305 ? kart sarmal\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ?n i\uc1 \u231 ?indeki gizli bir matematiksel ba\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u305 ?nt\uc1 \u305 ?y\uc1 \u305 ? ya da kurgusal bo\uc1 \u351 ?lu\uc1 \u287 ?u fark edip, onu kendi yarat\uc1 \u305 ?c\uc1 \u305 ? hamlesiyle tamamlamak \uc1 \u252 ?zere yeni bir girdi verir. Sistem bu girdiyi ald\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u305 ?nda, Mavi Hat ve K\uc1 \u305 ?rm\uc1 \u305 ?z\uc1 \u305 ? Hat o g\uc1 \u246 ?r\uc1 \u252 ?nmez Reflection Boundary (Yans\uc1 \u305 ?ma E\uc1 \u351 ?i\uc1 \u287 ?i) \uc1 \u252 ?zerinde \uc1 \u231 ?arp\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u351 ?\uc1 \u305 ?r. Aray\uc1 \u252 ?z, kullan\uc1 \u305 ?c\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ?n kendi eme\uc1 \u287 ?ini, kendi d\uc1 \u252 ?\uc1 \u351 ?\uc1 \u252 ?nce haritas\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ? \uc1 \u231 ?\uc1 \u305 ?kt\uc1 \u305 ?ya yans\uc1 \u305 ?tarak katman\uc1 \u305 ? tamamen a\uc1 \u231 ?ar. Davran\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u351 ?sal Kar\uc1 \u351 ?\uc1 \u305 ?l\uc1 \u305 ?k: Kullan\uc1 \u305 ?c\uc1 \u305 ? pasif bir t\uc1 \u252 ?ketici gibi "haz\uc1 \u305 ?r bir i\uc1 \u231 ?eri\uc1 \u287 ?i" t\uc1 \u252 ?ketmemi\uc1 \u351 ?tir; o i\uc1 \u231 ?eri\uc1 \u287 ?i sistemle birlikte, kendi zihinsel \uc1 \u231 ?abas\uc1 \u305 ?yla var etmi\uc1 \u351 ?tir. Kullan\uc1 \u305 ?c\uc1 \u305 ?n\uc1 \u305 ?n g\uc1 \u246 ?zlerinde o en saf \uc1 \u231 ?ocuksu par\uc1 \u305 ?lt\uc1 \u305 ? belirir: "Bunu ben ke\uc1 \u351 ?fettim!" Bu an, s\uc1 \u305 ?\uc1 \u287 ? dopamin d\uc1 \u246 ?ng\uc1 \u252 ?lerinin tamamen \uc1 \u231 ?\uc1 \u246 ?kt\uc1 \u252 ?\uc1 \u287 ?\uc1 \u252 ?, yerini kal\uc1 \